First real target test:
swim enter-debug --port /dev/ttyACM0

Probe after `enter-debug` succeeds:
swim probe --port /dev/ttyACM0

Read the first 256 bytes of program flash:
swim read --addr 0x8000 --len 8096 --out fw

Flash command shape:
swim flash --device stm8s103f3 --file firmware.ihx --verify --reset

The current firmware intentionally refuses erase/program commands until the
flash sequence is hardware-validated.

Unlock flash or EEPROM without erasing:
swim unlock --device stm8s103f3 --flash
swim unlock --device stm8s103f3 --eeprom
